      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792643481028,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "先报价再交易 · 启动 autopilot 前复述并等“是”\n只用 mantle-meme · 不碰 root key、不读不打印环境变量\n被拒绝就停，不换个办法重试",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "先报价再交易 · 启动 autopilot 前复述并等“是”\n只用 mantle-meme · 不碰 root key、不读不打印环境变量\n被拒绝就停，不换个办法重试",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
    {
