      "versionNonce": 2143397273,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792643481028,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "只挂 OpenClaw 状态、agent home、skills（只读）\n没有 root key、没有 ~/.mantle-aa、没有 docker socket\n但容器里的 agent 密码、bot token、模型登录，它都读得到",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "只挂 OpenClaw 状态、agent home、skills（只读）\n没有 root key、没有 ~/.mantle-aa、没有 docker socket\n但容器里的 agent 密码、bot token、模型登录，它都读得到",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "t-394",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 310,
      "y": 374,
      "width": 384.9296875,
      "height": 20.8,
      "angle": 0,
